<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 22.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 22.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by Eesti Raadio on Thursday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Italian president Oscar Luigi Scalfaro started his visit to Estonia.</p>
<p>- The insolvent peat factory in Oru was sold to Freesturvas.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
